 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Family and gender",
   "texto": [
    "In Polish, **mama** and **siostra** are feminine; **tata** and **brat** are masculine. There are no items like «the» and «the»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Possessive",
   "texto": [
    "**Mój** accompanies a masculine name: **mój brat**. **Moja** accompanies one feminine: **moja mama**.",
    "**To jest moja rodzina** means «This is my family.»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Have",
   "texto": [
    "**Mam** means «I have» and **masz** means «You got it.». In **Jak się masz?**, the natural translation is «How are you?».",
    "After **mam**, the name may change: **brat → brata**, **siostra → siostrę**."
   ]
  },
